# Menu smoke test (docs/re/ui_phase5.md "Input scripts"), 1280x720, 60 fps clock:
#   SDL_VIDEODRIVER=offscreen ./build-game/ProjectY --data data --frames 2000 --input tools/ui/menu_smoke.input
# Expected: three screenshots, then the run ends at frame 641 via the menu's Exit button.
# Phase 5d: with a save dir holding an options.txt of this revision (LastVersion) the
# main menu comes after the intro; without one (first start, or an empty --save-dir)
# the update news screen comes first - the click at 482 then misses, Escape goes
# Back to the main menu and the run still ends via Exit.
120 screenshot ui_intro.png            # the Luminence Labs logo
470 screenshot ui_menu.png             # the main menu after the camera glide
480 mousemove 637 205                  # hover "Singleplayer"
482 click left 637 205                 # -> screen 1 (the camera scrolls there)
560 screenshot ui_singleplayer.png
key escape                             # Back -> main menu
+80 click left 570 558                 # "Exit"
